## Layer rules (onion)

1. **Domain** (`src/domain/`) — innermost layer. Entities, repository
   interfaces (ports), domain services. Zero Flask imports. Pure Python.
2. **Application** (`src/application/`) — use cases and DTOs. Orchestrates
   domain entities via interfaces. No Flask imports.
3. **Infrastructure** (`src/infrastructure/`) — outermost layer. SQLAlchemy
   persistence adapters, Flask blueprints. Depends on domain and application.

